{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13221010.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221010","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1322101001:0":{"text":"캐롤라이나, 캐롤라이나! 만나러 왔어요!","source_cn":"卡列琳娜，卡列琳娜！我们来看望你啦！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E9915567041DBD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1322101002:0":{"text":"치피, 그렇게 부르면 실례잖아. 먼저 문들 두드려야지!","source_cn":"满满，这样喊太失礼了，要先敲门！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79E3171C385FD4C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13221020.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221020","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322102001:0":{"text":"어라, 아무도 없는 것 같은데요?","source_cn":"咦？没有人在吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81F82A5700BAE772","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322102002:0":{"text":"캐롤라이나가 산책하러 간 건 아닐까요? 주변을 한번 찾아봐요.","source_cn":"或许卡列琳娜出来散步了，咱们在周围找找看吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1A2C809D74689BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13221030.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221030","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1322103001:0":{"text":"보세요! 캐롤라이나가 저기 있어요!","source_cn":"看，卡列琳娜在那里！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA17E2EEF5079459","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13221040.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221040","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322104001:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 안녕하세요. 갑자기 여기까지 오시다니, 무슨 일이라도 생기셨나요?","source_cn":"你好，<style=stress><player_na...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xABE9DDF41270B56B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 안녕하세요. 갑자기 여기까지 오시다니, 무슨 일이라도 생기셨나요?","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 안녕하세요. 갑자기 여기까지 오시다니, 무슨 일이라도 생기셨나요?","variant_male_record_index":"149128","variant_female_record_index":"149129","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322104002:1":{"text":"아니요! 그냥 당신을 만나러 왔어요. 캐롤라이나, 카렌과 요즘은 어떻게 지내고 있나요?","source_cn":"不是啦！我们只是想来看看你而已。卡列琳娜，你和铐兰最近...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27733EBEADC6156A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322104003:1":{"text":"걱정해줘서 고마워요. 저는 잘 지내고 있답니다. 카렌 오빠도 이제 정상으로 돌아온 것 같아요.","source_cn":"谢谢你们的关心，我很好，铐兰哥哥看起来也恢复了正常。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C0F2B64FD1DC76B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1322104003":{"text":"걱정해줘서 고마워요. 저는 잘 지내고 있답니다. 카렌 오빠도 이제 정상으로 돌아온 것 같아요.","source_cn":"谢谢你们的关心，我很好，铐兰哥哥看起来也恢复了正常。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C0F2B64FD1DC76B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322104004:1":{"text":"사실... 제 일 때문에 그런 건 아니랍니다.","source_cn":"其实……我并不是为了自己的事情。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88BA832F40817B9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322104006:1":{"text":"얼음의 악마에 대한 소문이 퍼진 이후로 사람들이 모두 불안해하고 있어요. 대공, 공주, 대주교... 차례로 목숨을 잃으면서 공국은 혼란에 빠졌고, 수도원 역시 타락에 휩쓸리면서 간신히 유지만 되고 있는 상황이지요.","source_cn":"冰之恶魔的事情传开之后，人们都很恐慌。大公、公主、大主...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B1DA8633FF34C08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322104007:1":{"text":"듀라 님이시여. 저는 화이트마운틴 사람들이 이 혼란을 잘 헤쳐나갈 수 있도록 돕고 싶어요. 하지만 여러분도 알다시피... 사람들은 그레이브본을 두려워하죠.","source_cn":"艾雅在上，我……希望能帮助白山的人们度过这段混乱的日子...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x324CF0279403518F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322104008:1":{"text":"저희는 사악한 존재가 아니지만 화이트마운틴에 수백 년 동안 이어져온 인식을 바꾸는 건 얼음의 악마를 처치하는 것보다 어렵답니다.","source_cn":"虽然我们并不邪恶，可想要改变在白山流传了千百年的认知，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD63127427F5D97C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1322104009:1":{"text":"여러분만 괜찮으시다면 사람들에게 도움의 손길을 내밀어주세요. 저는 최선을 다해 여러분을 돕겠습니다.","source_cn":"如果你们愿意，我希望你们能向大家伸出援手，我会尽全力协助。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3762FF54772BD355","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1322104010:1":{"text":"어쩌면... 사람들이 그레이브본에 대해 다시 생각하게 될 수도 있겠네요. 그렇다면 언젠가 그들이 저희를 두려워하지 않고 친구가 되어 평화롭게 공존할 수 있을지도 몰라요.","source_cn":"或许……人们会因此开始重新认识亡灵。终有一天，大家会不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEE370A0F043E5BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1322104011:1":{"text":"알겠어요. 캐롤라이나! 우리가 꼭 도와줄게요.","source_cn":"我明白了，卡列琳娜。我们一定会帮忙的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BB8C9586783B361","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1322104012:1":{"text":"감사합니다. 듀라 님의 가호가 함께하시기를.","source_cn":"谢谢，愿艾雅保佑你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8D4F926F66C450B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:0:1":{"text":"얼굴에 근심이 가득한걸","source_cn":"但你看上去在发愁","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1F671AF29462CED3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"얼굴에 근심이 가득한걸","female":"얼굴에 근심이 가득한걸","variant_male_record_index":"69416","variant_female_record_index":"69417","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1322104005:1":{"text":"괜찮아요, 캐롤라이나! 미안하다고 생각할 필요 없어요!","source_cn":"没关系的，卡列琳娜，不用觉得不好意思！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79FE3273D1515E06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:1:2":{"text":"정말 도와주지 않아도 돼?","source_cn":"真的不需要帮忙吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x34BA812F002062C4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"정말 도와주지 않아도 돼?","female":"정말 도와주지 않아도 돼?","variant_male_record_index":"69418","variant_female_record_index":"69419","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卡列琳娜":{"text":"캐롤라이나","source":"卡列琳娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":16,"localized_text_count":15,"speaker_count":3}}}}